    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to Voicemail app</li>
	<li>Create and activate a Greeting, assign it to a specific recipient/contact, ensure it's</li>
	<li>within the configured time/day schedule.</li>
	<li>Have that recipient call the test device.</li>
	<li>Let the call go unanswered for the configured delay (5 seconds) so the greeting begins playing.</li>
	<li>While the greeting audio is actively playing, answer/pick up the call.</li>
	<li>Observe whether the greeting audio stops.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected</b> <b>Result</b>: As soon as the call is answered, the greeting playback should immediately stop, and the call should proceed normally as a live conversation between the two parties.</p>

<p><b>Actual</b> <b>Result</b>: The greeting message continues playing even after the call has been answered.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

