            <p><b>Steps</b> :</p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to Voicemail app</li>
	<li>create new greeting message </li>
	<li>set the time ,recipients,repeat day at current time and day </li>
	<li>save it </li>
	<li>make a call during at the start or end time during by recipient</li>
	<li>wait 5 second</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> After 5 seconds from the call time, the configured greeting message should play.</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> The configured greeting message does not play after 5 seconds from the call time.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

