    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail app info</li>
	<li>go to permission</li>
	<li>Select contact</li>
	<li>Don't allow contact </li>
	<li>go to Voicemail app </li>
	<li>Create a Greeting, record audio, set a Title.</li>
	<li>Go to Greeting settings → Select Recipients.</li>
	<li>again go to Select a group </li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> A clear message should indicate that contact access is denied, with an option to open the device’s contact permission settings and grant access.</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> The <b>Recipients</b> and <b>Group</b> pages continue loading indefinitely without displaying any message or option.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

