    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Select the Create New Greeting button</li>
	<li>Create a Greeting, record audio,</li>
	<li>Enter only space character(s) (press spacebar,) in title.</li>
	<li>Tap Save.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> App should validate that Title contains actual meaningful text </p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> The app accepts a whitespace-only Title and saves successfully, with no validation error.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
