    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps :</b></p>
<ol>
	<li>Go to Voicemail app</li>
	<li>Create a New greeting</li>
	<li>Go to Greeting settings → Select a Group.</li>
	<li>Ensure the device has contact groups synced from multiple sources </li>
	<li>Observe how the group list is displayed.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> Groups should be visually separated/labeled by their source, with a section header for each (e.g., "GOOGLE" as a section divider above Google-synced groups, "WHATSAPP" above WhatsApp groups)</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> All groups are shown in a single flat list with no source separation/labeling</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

