    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Select the Create New Greeting button</li>
	<li>Here, observe the header</li>
	<li>create that greetings </li>
	<li>go to the greeting settings go to Select Recipients option </li>
	<li>view the header</li>
	<li>Again go to select group option</li>
	<li> </li>
	<li>view the header</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected result</b> : Here in Recording page need to show "New Greeting",in Recipient page header need to show "Select Recipients".Gro group selection page need to show "Select Groups"</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> : In all the case header text was fixed shows "GET PERSONAL"</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
