    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></p>
<ol>
	<li>Go to Voicemail App → Greetings tab.</li>
	<li>Tap <b>"Create New Greeting."</b></li>
	<li>Observe the header text on the recording screen.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> Header should display <b>"New Greeting"</b> </p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> Header displays <b>"GET PERSONAL"</b> instead of "<b>New Greeting</b>"</p>
