    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Note the Voicemail app's install date (Day 1 of the 14-day trial).</li>
	<li>Go to device <b>Settings → Date &amp; Time</b>, turn off "Automatic date &amp; time."</li>
	<li>Manually advance the device date to a point <b>beyond</b> the 14-day trial window).</li>
	<li>Open the Voicemail app.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> The app should detect the trial has expired and display the <b>"TRIAL PERIOD HAS EXPIRED"</b> screen, blocking further use until purchase.</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> The expired-trial screen does not appear — the app continues to function normally as if the trial were still active, with no restriction or warning shown.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

