    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></p>
<ol>
	<li>Install the Voicemail app fresh (trial starts, 14-day period begins).</li>
	<li>Note the exact install date.</li>
	<li>Go to device <b>Settings → Date &amp; Time</b>, turn off "Automatic date &amp; time."</li>
	<li>Manually advance the device date to a point within the <b>final 3 days</b> of the 14-day trial </li>
	<li>Open the Voicemail app and check the Greetings screen.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> The trial expiry banner ("Your trial period expires in 3 DAYS | PURCHASE") should appear on the Greetings screen once within the final 3 days of the trial.</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> No banner appears — the Greetings screen looks the same as it did on day 1 of the trial, with no indication the trial is nearing expiration.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

