        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps :</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to voice mail</li>
	<li>go to status </li>
	<li>create new status giving a voice message and title</li>
	<li>active the quick status </li>
	<li>make a call in that phone</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> Quick status voice message need to play on the phone which will call me at that time.</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> Quick status message recording playing on my phone rather than the caller.</p>
