    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps :</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to New Greeting screen.</li>
	<li>Tap the mic to start recording.</li>
	<li>Let it record for a few seconds.</li>
	<li>Tap the mic to stop recording.</li>
	<li>Observe the status label/state shown on screen.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> The screen should display <b>Stopped</b></p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> The screen displays <b>"Stoped"</b> instead of "<b>Stopped</b>" after tapping the mic button.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
