    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to Voicemail App → Settings.</li>
	<li>Open the <b>Help</b> page.</li>
	<li>Review the content provided.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> The Help page should give the user a clear explanation of the app's <b>core features</b></p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> The Help page only explains how to <b>stop the Personal Voicemail service</b>, with no information on how Greetings or Quick Status actually function.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
