    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps :</b></p>
<ol>
	<li>Go to Voicemail App → Settings.</li>
	<li>Tap the <b>"Time before greeting"</b> field (currently showing "5").</li>
	<li>Change the value to <b>10</b> (or 15/20/25).</li>
	<li>Confirm/save the selection</li>
	<li>Navigate away from Settings </li>
	<li>Return to Settings.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> The "Time before greeting" field should retain the value you selected (e.g., "10"), persisting across navigation.</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> The field always resets back to <b>"5"</b>, regardless of what value was selected.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

