    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Fresh install the app (or clear app data to simulate first launch).</li>
	<li>Open the app — the "Welcome to Get Personal Voicemail" screen appears.</li>
	<li>Tap <b>"try Voicemail FREE for 2 weeks"</b>.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> Tapping the free trial link should grant the user 2 weeks of full access to the app without requiring purchase, and take them into the main Greetings/Quick Status screen.</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> Tapping the free trial link does not work. The only way to proceed past this screen and access the rest of the app is by tapping <b>"PURCHASE FOR ONLY $2.99"</b>.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

