        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></p>
<ol>
	<li>Go to Voicemail App → Settings.</li>
	<li>Tap the <b>"Purchase $2.99"</b> row.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result:</b> Tapping this row should navigate to a purchase screen</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b> Nothing happens — tapping the row does not navigate anywhere or trigger any visible response.</p>
