    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Select the Create New Greeting button</li>
	<li>Create a Greeting, record audio, set a Title.</li>
	<li>Go to Greeting settings → Select Recipients.</li>
	<li>Select several contacts (e.g., 2 contacts) — confirm count shows "2".</li>
	<li>Tap to <b>deselect</b> one of the previously selected contacts.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected result</b> : Once deselected, the contact should visually update immediately</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> : Sometimes the contact <b>still appears visually selected</b> </p>
