    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Go to Greeting settings screen.</li>
	<li>Tap the <b>From</b> time field.</li>
	<li>In the time picker, select a time using <b>AM/PM</b> format (e.g., select 9:00 AM).</li>
	<li>Confirm the selection.</li>
	<li>Observe the value now shown in the From field on the main screen.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected result</b> : In the time field needs to show 12 hour fromat time</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> : Here it showing the 24-hours time format</p>
