    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Select the Create New Greeting button</li>
	<li>Create a Greeting, record audio, set a Title.</li>
	<li>Create another Greeting, record audio, set a Title.</li>
	<li>go to the first Greeting</li>
	<li>add a group and recipients under that group</li>
	<li>save it</li>
	<li>go to the second greetings </li>
	<li>go to select group see if there shows previously selected group and those number</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected result</b> : Since it's the same group, the contacts assigned to it should be consistent and visible <b>regardless of which Greeting viewing it from</b></p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> : The group appears with no contacts when accessed from Greeting second one, even though contacts were added to it via Greeting first one.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

