    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Select the Create New Greeting button</li>
	<li>press on start recording</li>
	<li>give a greeting voice with title</li>
	<li>save it</li>
	<li>create some greeting voice like this</li>
	<li>in home page click all the audio play button</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected result</b> : Starting playback of a new recording should automatically stop/pause the currently playing one</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> : Both recordings play simultaneously, overlapping audio.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
