    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Select the Create New Greeting button</li>
	<li>press on start recording</li>
	<li>give a greeting voice with title</li>
	<li>save it with a title with a 400-character length</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected result</b> : Title field should enforce a reasonable maximum character limit to 50 characters for such short-label field</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> : No validation message arise.Besides, none of save or delete button visible clearly</p>
            <br/>
