    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Select the Create New Greeting button</li>
	<li>press on start recording</li>
	<li>Stop recording with 0 duration</li>
	<li>save it with a title </li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected result</b> : Title field should enforce to save this message for 0 this duration</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> : No validation message arise and saved successfully</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
