	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Select the Create New Greeting button</li>
	<li>press on start recording</li>
	<li>give a greeting voice with title</li>
	<li>save it with a title </li>
	<li>then go that created greeting </li>
	<li>In time field, give 'From' time set later than 'To' time</li>
	<li>set repeat day as Monday</li>
	<li>save it</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected result</b> : App should validate that To time must be later than From time</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> : The app accepts From time later than To time with no error, and saves successfully.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

