        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Select the Create New Greeting button</li>
	<li>press on start recording</li>
	<li>give a greeting voice with title</li>
	<li>save it with a title </li>
	<li>then go that created greeting </li>
	<li>fill the time </li>
	<li>save it</li>
	<li>go to again that greeting</li>
	<li>click on greeting from and to time</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected result</b> : As previously save time while clicking on both of the time it should appear with the it has been selected</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> : The app Time picker shows default value instead of previously saved</p>
