    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b>:</p>
<ul>
	<li>go to Voicemail App</li>
	<li>Select the Create New Greeting button</li>
	<li>press on start recording</li>
	<li>give a greeting voice with title</li>
	<li>Pause it </li>
	<li>again start it</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Expected result</b> : Recording should resume from where it was paused</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> : Recording restarts from <b>0:00</b>, and the previously recorded audio  is lost/discarded.</p>
